# TEJAS Lite package list: fits in ONE download under 2 GB.
# The big apps (GIMP, Krita, Blender, Kdenlive, OBS, Inkscape, games, Wine) install
# after setup with one click from the "Get more apps" icon (tejas-get-apps).
# One Debian 13 package per line; '#' starts a comment.
# build.sh checks every name and skips (with a warning) any that don't exist,
# so a typo or a renamed package never breaks the whole build.

